# 统一行尾为 LF，避免跨平台协作时产生无意义的整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary

# Windows 脚本保留 CRLF，否则 PowerShell 可能执行异常
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
